#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374719
msgid "Quitting smoking is easy! Why, I've quit 20 times myself."
msgstr "戒烟很简单！我都戒过20次了。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374730
msgid ""
"I can't promise you I won't do bad things, but\n"
"I will promise you this: I'll never make us look bad."
msgstr ""
"我不能保证自己不做坏事，但\n"
"我向你保证：我绝不会让我们丢脸。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374731
msgid ""
"Well now, looks like my boys gave you some trouble. Sorry 'bout that.\n"
"I'll make it up to you. Here, take this."
msgstr ""
"哎呀，看来我的手下给你添麻烦了。抱歉啊。\n"
"我会补偿你的。来，拿着这个。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374732
msgid "Let's use our heads on this one."
msgstr "这事咱们得动动脑子。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374733
msgid ""
"Everybody can do something, but nobody can do everything.\n"
"We'll do the things you can't.\n"
"And we need you to do the things we can't!"
msgstr ""
"谁都能做点事，但没人能做所有事。\n"
"你做不了的，我们来做。\n"
"我们做不了的，就靠你了！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374734
msgid ""
"Ah, Boss, glad you're here. We were short one guy tonight.\n"
"Care to join us for a little game?"
msgstr ""
"啊，BOSS，你来得正好。今晚我们缺一个人。\n"
"要不要来玩一局？"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374735
msgid "You want me to forget last night...? Too late. It's all in my diary now."
msgstr "你想让我忘了昨晚……？太迟了。全写在我日记里了。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374736
msgid ""
"You're our greatest hope, Boss!\n"
"We won't let anybody take our hope from us!\n"
"I may not be strong, but I'll fight till the end!"
msgstr ""
"你是我们最大希望，BOSS！\n"
"不会让任何人夺走它！\n"
"我不够强，但会战到最后！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374737
msgid "What the hell, let's have fun out there!"
msgstr "管他呢，咱们好好玩一场！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374738
msgid "Ohhh... my stomach..."
msgstr "哦哦……我的胃……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374739
msgid "When we're all done here, I think I'm going to start my own business."
msgstr "等这里的事都结束了，我想自己开个店。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374750
msgid "Kill 'em, let 'em live... it's up to you. Either way, give 'em hell!!"
msgstr "杀还是放，由你定。不管怎样，狠狠打！！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374751
msgid "Awaiting orders, Boss!!"
msgstr "等命令，BOSS！！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374752
msgid "I'm bringin' home the bacon!"
msgstr "我要带着战利品回家啦！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374753
msgid ""
"It's either us or them!\n"
"That's right. That's ...the way it should be, in a war."
msgstr ""
"不是他们死就是我们亡！\n"
"没错。战争……本来就该是这样。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374754
msgid "Sometimes it's good to grab life by the horns."
msgstr "有时候就该放手一搏。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374755
msgid "Looks like another late night at the office..."
msgstr "看来又要在办公室熬夜了……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374756
msgid "You're number one, Boss. That makes me number two, right?"
msgstr "你是第一，BOSS。那我就是第二，对吧？"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374757
msgid ""
"198, 199, 200! Oh, hey, Boss, you're just in time!\n"
"I just finished doing 200 stomach crunches!"
msgstr ""
"198、199、200！哦，嘿，BOSS，你来得正好！\n"
"我刚做完200个仰卧起坐！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374758
msgid "For the last time, stop treating me like a rookie!"
msgstr "最后说一次，别把我当新兵！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374759
msgid "I could learn to like this outfit."
msgstr "这身行头我能穿惯。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a30
msgid "Nothing feeds a developer like the sound of a satisfied user."
msgstr "用户满意的一句话，就是开发者最好的食粮。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a31
msgid "Why do it toda-a-ay? There's always tomorro-o-ow..."
msgstr "干嘛非今天做？还有明天嘛……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a32
msgid ""
"Ahhh, we got a nice big catch today!\n"
"Tonight's dinner is gonna be fresh sashimi with cold Japanese sake."
msgstr ""
"啊哈，今天大丰收！\n"
"今晚就吃新鲜刺身配冰镇日本酒。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a33
msgid ""
"I love to grill things. My favorite food is stir-fried noodles.\n"
"Those grilled chicken skewers they got in Japan are pretty good, too."
msgstr ""
"我喜欢烤东西。最爱吃炒面。\n"
"日本那种烤鸡肉串也挺不错。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a34
msgid "I'm saving up all the money I make here, so when I get back to the States, I can go to college..."
msgstr "我把在这里挣的钱都存着，等回美国就能上大学了……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a35
msgid "No need for you to go, Boss... I got this one covered."
msgstr "BOSS，你不用去……这个我来搞定。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a36
msgid ""
"We're not blood related, but we're still family.\n"
"Come back home alive brother. "
msgstr ""
"我们没血缘，但还是一家人。\n"
"活着回家，兄弟。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a37
msgid "This place can only hold so many bodies. So make sure you bring back the best you can find. At least as good as me."
msgstr "这地方只能装这么多人。所以带回来的兵越强越好，至少跟我一样。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a38
msgid "A lot of the most talented soldiers out there are in places where you can't recover them the usual way. I know there's gotta be some way to get them, but..."
msgstr "很多最有才华的士兵都在你无法用常规方式回收的地方。我知道肯定有办法招到他们，但……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a39
msgid "To get the higher-ranked weapons, you'll need to find the design specs and raise the level of the R&D Team. Guess you got your work cut out for you in the field and at Mother Base..."
msgstr "要获得更高等级的武器，你需要找到开发规格并提升研发班的等级。看来你在战场和母基地都有得忙了……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a50
msgid "From what I've heard, supposedly there's a way to have items and ammo delivered right to you in the middle of a mission..."
msgstr "据我所知，应该有办法在任务中途把物品和弹药直接送到你手上……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a51
msgid ""
"Back in my old unit, the commander used to tell us at morning calisthenics: \"Whenever you're in trouble, hit the START button!!\"\n"
"Wonder how he's doing these days,"
msgstr ""
"在我以前部队里，指挥官早上做体操时常说：“遇到麻烦就按 START 键！！”\n"
"不知道他现在怎么样了，"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a52
msgid ""
"I-I saw some gigantic footprints in the swamp around El Cenagal...\n"
"Y-you think it's a monstruo?"
msgstr ""
"我，我在 El Cenagal 沼泽看到巨大脚印……\n"
"你，你觉得是怪物吗？"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a53
msgid ""
"The other day, out of the blue we got a big box delivered to us.\n"
"No return address, but it was full of all kinds of good stuff...\n"
"Kind of creepy, I know... but I wasn't about to complain!"
msgstr ""
"前几天，我们突然收到一个大箱子。\n"
"没有寄件地址，但里面装满了各种好东西……\n"
"我知道有点诡异……但我可不会抱怨！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a54
msgid "For me, there's no greater thrill than seeing your exploits in PLAYER DATA, Boss!"
msgstr "对我来说，在 PLAYER DATA 看你的战绩最刺激，BOSS！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a55
msgid "With word about MSF going around, no wonder there are more volunteers who want to join."
msgstr "随着 MSF 的名声传开，难怪有更多志愿者想加入。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a56
msgid "I swear I saw fireworks last time I was in combat. Do they really make a weapon like that?"
msgstr "我发誓上次战斗时看到了烟花。他们真的造出了那种武器吗？"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a57
msgid "When I fire my weapon, I never aim for the head. Can't recruit 'em if they're dead, after all."
msgstr "我开枪时从不瞄准头部。毕竟死了就没法招募了。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a58
msgid "Some crates are too big to climb alone, but they're no problem if you got a buddy. Maybe that's what friendship is all about."
msgstr "有些箱子太大，一个人爬不上去，但有同伴就没问题。也许这就是友谊的意义。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a59
msgid "If you ever get stuck in a mission, retreating is always an option! Isn't that right?"
msgstr "如果任务中卡住了，撤退永远是个选择！对吧？"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a70
msgid "Boss! The R&D Team is screwing around! They are playing with the cardboard boxes! What the hell is that?!"
msgstr "BOSS！研发班在瞎搞！他们在玩纸箱！那到底是什么鬼？！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a71
msgid "In combat, running out of ammo is a death sentence. Steal some from the enemy if you have to, or call for resupply, or search around the area! Good luck!"
msgstr "战斗中弹药耗尽等于死刑。必要时从敌人那里偷一些，或者呼叫补给，或者搜索周围区域！祝你好运！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a72
msgid "You can't attack while reloading. So find someplace to take cover when you do! That's what's kept me alive all these years."
msgstr "装弹时无法攻击。所以装弹时找个地方掩护！这就是我这么多年活下来的秘诀。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a73
msgid "Enemy hiding out of sight? Try the night-vision goggles. That's what I do."
msgstr "敌人藏在视线外？试试夜视镜。我就是这么做的。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a74
msgid "Suppressors don't last forever. Use them enough and they wear out. Best to keep an eye on how long they've got left."
msgstr "消音器不是永久的。用得多了就会磨损。最好留意剩余寿命。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a75
msgid "Whoa, almost screwed up back there... All because I didn't read the intel in the BRIEFING FILES first... You gotta use your brains, not just your brawn."
msgstr "哇，刚才差点搞砸了……都怪我没先读简报文件里的情报……你得用脑子，不能只靠蛮力。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a76
msgid "They say when you CO-OPS with somebody, you can tell who they regard as the greatest hero they've gone CO-OPS with. "
msgstr "据说和别人进行合作任务时，能看出谁是他们合作过的最伟大的英雄。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a77
msgid "I always go into a mission empty-handed. I can always borrow gear from my teammates."
msgstr "我总是空手进入任务。反正可以从队友那里借装备。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a78
msgid "Flying enemies are weak against explosions. Damage 'em with a missile and it might create an opening... right, Boss?"
msgstr "飞行敌人怕爆炸。用导弹造成伤害，也许能制造破绽……对吧，BOSS？"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a79
msgid "The canopies on attack choppers are pretty solid, but you can break though them. It's the only way to get at the pilot inside... But you probably already knew that."
msgstr "攻击直升机的座舱盖相当坚固，但你可以打破它。这是接近里面飞行员的唯一方法……不过你大概已经知道了。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a90
msgid "A helicopter uses its tail rotor to combat counter-torque. In other words, without it the chopper can't fly straight. You could say it's like the chopper's jugular vein."
msgstr "直升机用尾桨对抗反扭矩。换句话说，没有它直升机就无法直线飞行。可以说它是直升机的颈静脉。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a91
msgid "My instructor told me when you get up close and personal with the enemy, CQC works better than a rifle! I'm gonna practice every chance I get!"
msgstr "教官说过，近身贴近敌人时，CQC比步枪更好用！我得一有机会就练！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a92
msgid "It's tough to see where you're going in the Ruinas de Xochiquetzal in Central Heredia. I wouldn't trust my eyes too much if I were you..."
msgstr "在埃雷迪亚中部的索奇克察尔遗迹，很难看清前方。要是我的话，可不会太相信自己的眼睛……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a93
msgid "The last war I was in, I attached an extra weapon to the barrel of my assault rifle. It's kind of tricky to switch between them, but once you get used to it you'll wonder how you ever got on without it."
msgstr "上次参战时，我在突击步枪的枪管上装了附加武器。切换起来有点麻烦，不过习惯了就离不开了。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a94
msgid ""
"Sneak up behind the enemy and hold 'em up, then make sure you Fulton recover 'em! ...That's how I do it.\n"
"Leave 'em with their hands up for too long and you never know when they're gonna turn their guns on you again."
msgstr ""
"绕到敌人背后举枪威胁，然后一定要用富尔顿回收！……我就是这么干的。\n"
"让他们举着手太久，说不准什么时候又会朝你开枪。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a95
msgid "Night-vision goggles aren't just useful at night. Foggy jungle, enemy smoke grenade - they come in handy anytime you can't see more than a few feet in front of you."
msgstr "夜视仪不只晚上有用。雾大的丛林、敌人的烟雾弹——只要前方几尺外看不清，它就能派上用场。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a96
msgid "If only we had a weapon that let us capture those enemy heavy weapons without hurting them... maybe we could take them back to Mother Base and put them to use..."
msgstr "要是有一把武器能不伤分毫地夺取敌方重武器就好了……说不定还能带回母基地加以利用……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a97
msgid "Yup... MSF needs all the firepower it can get. Like mechs, for example. Capturing them from the enemy would be quickest. Or, there's the other way..."
msgstr "是啊……MSF需要一切能到手的火力。比如机甲。从敌人手里抢最快。或者，还有别的办法……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a98
msgid "There's two basic ways to take on a unit with a mech. Overwhelm them with sheer firepower, or take out the soldiers first and then capture the machine. Decisions, decisions..."
msgstr "对付有机甲的部队，基本有两种打法。用压倒性火力强攻，或者先解决士兵再夺取机器。真难抉择……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374a99
msgid "You're not gonna believe this, but... I saw this cat-thing rowing a little boat down by the Caribbean coast! Next time you're on a mission down there, see if you can find it!"
msgstr "你肯定不信，可是……我在加勒比海岸看见一只猫一样的东西在划小船！下次你去那边执行任务，找找看！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ab0
msgid "I love UMAs. Monsters, too... you know anybody who knows a lot about rare creatures? I want to pick their brain! Pick it CLEAN!"
msgstr "我最爱未知生物了。怪物也是……你认识谁很懂稀有生物吗？我想向他请教！请教个精光！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ab1
msgid "I don't care how good they taste, I HATE eating cold rations! If only we could grill 'em up a little... Then I'd be happy."
msgstr "我不管冷的军粮多好吃，我就是讨厌吃！要是能稍微烤一下……我就满足了。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ab2
msgid "Flying weapons are usually pretty noisy. They ought to be easy to find if you've got a Surround Indicator... right, Boss?"
msgstr "飞行武器通常都很吵。只要有环绕指示器，应该很容易找到……对吧，BOSS？"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ab3
msgid "They say there are monsters out there somewhere in this country, and if you hunt one down, you can use it to develop amazing gear. Of course, I don't believe a word of it."
msgstr "听说这个国家的某处有怪物，猎到它就能开发出惊人的装备。当然，我一个字都不信。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ab4
msgid "The fuel tanks on the enemy's heavy weapons are painted red. Seems like that'd be a good place to shoot them."
msgstr "敌方重武器的燃料罐漆成了红色。那地方看起来很适合射击。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ab5
msgid "Boss, did you know there's some kind of miracle gun that makes the sky do your bidding? Think we could make one here?"
msgstr "BOSS，你知道有种神奇的枪能让天空听你号令吗？咱们这儿也能造一把吗？"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ab6
msgid "Missile-type weapons are heavy and have low ammo capacity. But they pack the most firepower of any portable weapon. Exactly what you need against heavy weapons."
msgstr "导弹类武器又重，弹药又少。但它的火力是所有便携武器里最强的。对付重武器正合适。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ab7
msgid "Machine guns are powerful and carry a lot of ammo, so they're perfect for taking down mechs. Of course, they're also heavy and tough to handle..."
msgstr "机枪威力大、弹药多，打机甲再合适不过。当然，它也很重，不好操作……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ab8
msgid "Sniper rifles are the best for precision long-range shots. A lot of them even fire armor-piercing rounds."
msgstr "狙击步枪最适合远距离精准射击。很多还能发射穿甲弹。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ab9
msgid "Submachine guns are easy to aim, and they've got good rapid fire! Plus you can use them with a shield. You just have to get used to the muzzle jump, that's all."
msgstr "冲锋枪好瞄准，连射也快！还能配盾使用。只要习惯枪口上跳就行了。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ad0
msgid "Did you hear? Somebody said they saw \"God\" inside a truck somewhere..."
msgstr "听说有人在某处卡车里看见了“神”……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ad1
msgid "Assault rifles are all-around solid weapons in every respect. There's lots of custom parts for them, too, so it's worth doing some R&D..."
msgstr "突击步枪各方面都很均衡可靠。改装零件也多，值得研发一下……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ad2
msgid "Shotguns are AWESOME! They can blow away just about anything in one shot. Only problem is they got short range and low ammo."
msgstr "霰弹枪超棒！几乎一枪就能轰飞任何东西。唯一的问题是射程短、弹药少。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ad3
msgid "Handguns have short range and low firepower, but they've got great accuracy at close range and high-caliber ammo that stops targets in their tracks. And if you know when and how to use them, you can conserve your rifle ammo... That's a quote from the Boss. I learned it by heart!"
msgstr "手枪射程短、火力弱，但近距离精准度高，大口径弹药能让目标当场停住。懂得何时如何使用，还能省下步枪弹药……这是BOSS说的。我背得滚瓜烂熟！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ad4
msgid "The two things you gotta remember for sniper rifles are \"crouch\" and \"aim.\" I guess 'cause it makes your hands shake less!"
msgstr "狙击步枪要记住两点：“蹲下”和“瞄准”。大概是能让手少抖吧！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ad5
msgid "If you're using a one-handed weapon, you can equip a shield at the same time. And when it's not on your arm, it'll protect your back... isn't that what you said, Boss?"
msgstr "用单手武器时，可以同时装备盾牌。不在手臂上时，它还能护住后背……这是你说的吧，BOSS？"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ad6
msgid "Handguns are great for indoors and in tight spaces... 'cause they're easy to aim."
msgstr "手枪适合室内和狭窄空间……因为容易瞄准。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ad7
msgid "You're telling me armor-piercing rounds go through shields and helmets?! Man, talk about punch."
msgstr "你是说穿甲弹能打穿盾牌和头盔？！威力真猛。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ad8
msgid "Large-caliber handguns are the best tool for stopping the enemy from acting. AND they let you use CQC at the same time. If you find yourself surrounded, try going with a handgun."
msgstr "大口径手枪最能阻止敌人行动，还能同时用CQC。被包围时试试手枪。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ad9
msgid "You ever hear of these \"battle cries\" that make amazing things happen sometimes when you say them? Crazy, huh?"
msgstr "你听说过\"战吼\"吗？喊出来有时会发生神奇的事。很疯狂吧？"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374af0
msgid "You know what I like about working for you, Boss? You know how to complete a mission without hurting anybody, without them even knowing you're there."
msgstr "知道我喜欢为你工作的哪点吗，BOSS？你能不伤一人完成任务，他们甚至不知道你来过。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374af1
msgid "I thought my gear felt a little heavy... Turns out my guns alone weighed 20 pounds! No wonder my PSYCHE decreased. Heavier isn't always better, I guess."
msgstr "难怪觉得装备有点重……光枪就重20磅！难怪精神下降了。看来重不一定好。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374af2
msgid "Back when I was a rookie, I used to spray my assault rifle all over the place and waste ammo... You gotta stay focused, aim, and be smart with your trigger finger, fire in small bursts. It's not how many shots you fire, it's how many hit the target. I wish I'd realized that sooner... "
msgstr "我当新兵时，常乱扫突击步枪浪费弹药……要专注、瞄准、管好扳机，短点射。重要的不是开了几枪，而是命中几发。真希望早点明白……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374af3
msgid "Timing is everything in consecutive CQC, y'know. Gotta be cool, press the button at just the right time..."
msgstr "连续CQC全靠时机，懂吗。要冷静，在恰当时机按键……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374af4
msgid "Boss, if you find me lying face down on the battlefield you gotta revive me! Uh, but no mouth-to-mouth, please!"
msgstr "BOSS，要是看到我趴在地上，你得救我！呃，但别做人工呼吸！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374af5
msgid "In training I got CQC-thrown against a wall and got knocked out. Felt like it hurt at least twice as bad as a usual throw, too..."
msgstr "训练时我被CQC摔到墙上昏了过去。感觉比普通摔法疼至少两倍……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374af6
msgid "I bet even the toughest missions wouldn't be so bad for a two-man cell!  I'm gonna go look for somebody to team up and fight with!"
msgstr "我敢说再难的任务，两人小队也能应付！我要去找个搭档一起战斗！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374af7
msgid ""
"Hey Boss, can you teach me how to reload?\n"
"...Ahh, so that's it! Just push the Action Button with the weapon equipped! Thanks a bunch, Boss!"
msgstr ""
"嘿BOSS，能教我怎么换弹吗？\n"
"……啊，原来如此！装备武器时按动作键就行！多谢BOSS！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374af8
msgid "Reloading leaves you temporarily vulnerable. Timing your reloads is just as crucial as timing your shots. Isn't it, Boss?"
msgstr "换弹时会暂时毫无防备。把握换弹时机和把握开枪时机一样关键。对吧，BOSS？"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374af9
msgid "Hey Boss! Thanks for always listening to us grunts. I mean, even we can teach you something once in a while. Right?!"
msgstr "嘿BOSS！谢谢你总听我们这些小兵说话。偶尔我们也能教你点东西。对吧？！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b10
msgid "Chicks dig a man who smells like success!"
msgstr "女人爱闻着像成功的男人！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b11
msgid "Ahh, I get it... GMP is the sum total of MSF's income... the same way GNP expresses a country's total income..."
msgstr "啊，我懂了……GMP是MSF总收入的总和……就像GNP代表国家总收入一样……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b12
msgid "If the next mission looks too tough for you, take a break and focus on recruiting or developing weapons... Yeah, that's right, never be in too big of a hurry!"
msgstr "下个任务太难的话，就歇歇，专注招募或开发武器……对，别太着急！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b13
msgid "In MISSION PREP we have to be careful not just about what gear we bring, but what uniform we wear. Right, Boss?"
msgstr "任务准备时不仅要注意带什么装备，还要注意穿什么制服。对吧，BOSS？"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b14
msgid "Check out the MAP to see where the exits are. Pretty handy if you ever get lost."
msgstr "查看地图找出口。迷路时很方便。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b15
#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b16
msgid "I think we could do a lot better job if we had stronger guns. We oughta get working on developing some new weapons!"
msgstr "有更强的枪我们能干得更好。该开发新武器了！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b17
msgid "My great-grandpa used to tell me, \"Sonny, bananas are good for more than just eatin'.\""
msgstr "我曾祖父常说：\"孩子，香蕉不只用来吃。\""

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b18
msgid "Boss, let me deploy on EXTRA OPS! I can handle it!"
msgstr "BOSS，让我去额外任务吧！我能行！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b19
msgid "I've seen female soldiers being held prisoner. But I wasn't able to save them..."
msgstr "我见过被囚禁的女兵。但我没能救她们……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b30
msgid "If a target's helmet is getting in the way, shoot it off with a bullet. It works best if you do it before they notice you. Right?"
msgstr "目标头盔碍事的话，用子弹打掉。趁他们没发现你时最有效。对吧？"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b31
msgid "How fast a tranq dart works depends on where it hits... Ack, what the--? Unnhh... ZZZZ..."
msgstr "麻醉镖生效快慢取决于命中部位……呃，什么——？唔……ZZZZ……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b32
msgid "You gotta turn away as soon as you throw a stun grenade or you'll get stunned, too... Thanks for the tip, Boss!"
msgstr "扔完闪光弹得赶紧转身，不然自己也会被闪到……多谢提醒，BOSS！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b33
msgid "One day, we'll have the science to turn a man invisible. And when that day comes... heh heh."
msgstr "总有一天，科学能让人隐形。等那天到来……嘿嘿。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b34
msgid "When you're using a sniper rifle, slow down, take a deep breath, and concentrate. It's true... you can actually feel your hands get steadier!"
msgstr "用狙击枪时，放慢节奏，深吸一口气，集中精神。真的……你能感觉到手变稳了！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b35
msgid "A man's got to eat to live. If you forget to bring food along on a mission, you better be damn good..."
msgstr "人活着就得吃饭。出任务要是忘了带吃的，那你最好够强……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b36
msgid "Man, I could go for a nice cold soda... That'd really hit the spot..."
msgstr "唉，真想喝罐冰镇汽水……那才叫爽……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b37
msgid "The Analyzer tells you how good a soldier is, so you can pick the best ones to recruit... That's the most logical way to go about it."
msgstr "分析仪能看出士兵有多强，方便你挑最好的招募……这是最合理的做法。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b38
msgid "I like the M10... It's got a decent rate of fire and you can AUTO AIM it from a good distance."
msgstr "我喜欢M10……射速不错，还能在远距离自动瞄准。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b39
msgid "My dream is to invent a weapon that lets you Fulton recover somebody from a distance..."
msgstr "我的梦想是发明一种能远距离富尔顿回收人员的武器……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b50
msgid "So what if you get knocked out? A few good smacks and you'll wake right up!"
msgstr "被放倒又怎样？扇几巴掌就醒了！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b51
msgid "Every mech has a weakness, no matter how big it is... And I intend to find it!"
msgstr "再大的机甲也有弱点……我一定要找出来！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b52
msgid "I heard there's a suit that makes your footsteps almost silent. Imagine how useful that'd be for sneaking up on people from behind."
msgstr "听说有种衣服能让脚步声几乎消失。想想从背后偷袭有多好用。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b53
msgid "You ever try running around lugging a big, heavy weapon? It ain't easy. Ain't fast, either..."
msgstr "你试过扛着重武器到处跑吗？不容易，也跑不快……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b54
msgid "With a high enough morale, a soldier can do things he never thought possible. Me, I'm ready to rock!"
msgstr "士气够高，士兵就能做到想都不敢想的事。我嘛，随时准备大干一场！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b55
msgid "The golden rule of staff management is, let people do what they do best. So, where do you need me to go?"
msgstr "人员管理的黄金法则就是让人干最擅长的事。说吧，要我去哪？"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b56
msgid "Comrades, lets keep communication tight!  What...? You can't find the right words!? Well then make sure you set your \"CO-OPS COMM\" in \"MISSION PREP\" so it doesn't happen again!"
msgstr "兄弟们，保持联络畅通！什么……？找不到合适的词！？那就在\"任务准备\"里设好\"合作任务通讯\"，别再出这岔子！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b57
msgid "You know when you get a package, and it's exactly what you needed the most? I always get a little misty when that happens..."
msgstr "你懂那种收到包裹、正好是你最需要的东西的感觉吗？每次我都有点想哭……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b58
msgid "If I ever manage to get a girlfriend, I wanna take her inside a cardboard box... and spend some quality time together..."
msgstr "要是能交到女朋友，我想带她钻进纸箱里……共度美好时光……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374b59
msgid "I wonder if you could use a cardboard box as a step to get up to places you couldn't usually reach by yourself..."
msgstr "不知道能不能用纸箱垫脚，爬到平时够不到的地方……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e30
msgid "I coulda sworn I saw a guy who looked just like me... Hm. Must have been a coincidence."
msgstr "我发誓看到个长得跟我一模一样的人……嗯，肯定是巧合。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e31
msgid "It's nice to have a place to come back home to. I'm glad I joined up with you."
msgstr "有个能回来的地方真好。很高兴加入了你们。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e32
msgid "The food ain't too bad here. 'Course, it's nothing like my ma's."
msgstr "这儿的伙食还不错。当然，跟我妈做的没法比。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e33
msgid "I got a wife and daughter back in my home country. Gotta work hard so they can eat."
msgstr "我老家还有老婆和女儿。得拼命干活，让她们吃上饭。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e34
msgid "Boss, MSF is more than just you. Don't forget that."
msgstr "BOSS，MSF不只是你一个人的。别忘了。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e35
msgid "I'm saving up my pay to buy a house and get married!"
msgstr "我在攒工资，准备买房结婚！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e36
msgid "Man... I'm sick of people treating me like a rookie! Ugh..."
msgstr "唉……真受够被人当新兵了！烦……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e37
msgid "Yesterday's enemy is today's ally..."
msgstr "昨日的敌人是今日的盟友……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e38
msgid "You wanna know what's the most powerful weapon known to man? A good poker face."
msgstr "你知道人类已知最强的武器是什么吗？一张扑克脸。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e39
msgid "Need some luck? Stick with me and maybe some of mine will rub off."
msgstr "需要点运气？跟着我，说不定能沾点光。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e50
msgid "This place is full of morons... That's why I love it so much."
msgstr "这地方全是蠢货……所以我爱死这里了。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e51
msgid "Call me... ah, forget it. Call me whatever you want."
msgstr "叫我……算了。随便你怎么叫。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e52
msgid "Check out this tattoo. Each one of these stars stands for a battlefield I've slogged through... they're actually just stickers, but still..."
msgstr "看看这纹身。每颗星都代表我爬过的一个战场……其实都是贴纸，不过嘛……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e53
msgid "Support is just as crucial as combat! Anything you need, let me know!"
msgstr "支援和战斗一样重要！有需要就找我！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e54
msgid "I need a mission that REALLY gets me motivated..."
msgstr "我需要一个真让我有干劲的任务……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e55
msgid "The bacon in the mess hall was extra crispy this morning. I feel like I can do anything today."
msgstr "今早食堂的培根特别脆。感觉今天什么都能做到。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e56
msgid "Boss! That magazine I lent you before the last mission. Can I have it--what?! You left it out there?! I hadn't finished reading it!!"
msgstr "BOSS！上次任务前借你的那本杂志。能还我——什么？！你丢在外面了？！我还没看完呢！！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e57
msgid "Give me an order, Boss. I'm not what you'd call a self-starter."
msgstr "下命令吧，BOSS。我不是主动找活干的人。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e58
msgid "I got two yolks in my egg this morning. So I'm gonna work twice as hard today! ...Or at least complain half as much!"
msgstr "今早我的蛋里有两个蛋黄。所以今天我要加倍努力！……至少少抱怨一半！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e59
msgid "Boss! Send me into battle! I can handle it!"
msgstr "BOSS！派我上战场！我能行！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e70
msgid "I can never seem to balance work and pleasure. 'Cause whatever I'm working on turns into pleasure."
msgstr "我总平衡不了工作和娱乐。因为我干的活最后都变成娱乐。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e71
msgid "Hey Boss, let's get as many new guys as we can and make MSF into something REAL big!"
msgstr "嘿BOSS，咱们多招点新人，把MSF做大做强！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e72
msgid "We got skills, too, Boss! Take a look and see!"
msgstr "我们也有本事，BOSS！来看看吧！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e73
msgid "When's the party gonna start, amigo?"
msgstr "派对什么时候开始，朋友？"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e74
msgid "Wish I could see the Loch Ness Monster or Quetzalcoatl once in my life..."
msgstr "真希望这辈子能见一次尼斯湖水怪或羽蛇神……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e75
msgid "Boss! He says there's no Santa Claus! Santa's real, isn't he?!"
msgstr "BOSS！他说没圣诞老人！圣诞老人是真的吧？！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e76
msgid "Boss! He says Santa Claus is real! There's no such thing as Santa, is there?!"
msgstr "BOSS！他说圣诞老人是真的！圣诞老人根本不存在吧？！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e77
msgid "I may not look it, but I'm turning 48 this year."
msgstr "我可能看不出来，但我今年就48了。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e78
msgid "I'll be honest. I don't think I'm good enough. But I want to be. And I'm training hard."
msgstr "说实话，我觉得自己还不够格。但我想变强。我正拼命训练。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e79
msgid "Give yourself a little break once in a while, Boss."
msgstr "偶尔也给自己放个假吧，BOSS。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e90
msgid "I like you."
msgstr "我喜欢你。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e91
msgid "Everything about this place is hot, hot. The weather, the work..."
msgstr "这地方什么都热，热。天气、工作……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e92
msgid "I'm a mountain boy. All this water, and boats and stuff... erk. Give me a mission, quick..."
msgstr "我是山里长大的。这么多水、船什么的……呃。快给我个任务吧……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e93
msgid "It's an honor to serve under a hero like you."
msgstr "能在您这样的英雄手下效力，是我的荣幸。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e94
msgid "I can't sleep at night unless I clean my gun once a day. I'm itching for an overhaul..."
msgstr "一天不擦枪我就睡不着。手痒想大保养了……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e95
msgid "Thanks for the Costa Rican coffee. Best I ever tasted."
msgstr "谢谢你的哥斯达黎加咖啡。最好喝的。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e96
msgid "My wife was always good to me. Guess that's what \"love\" is."
msgstr "我妻子一直对我很好。大概这就是爱吧。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e97
msgid "If I die, we'll meet again in the next life. As comrades."
msgstr "如果我死了，来世再见。以同志的身份。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e98
msgid "One thing I've realized since I got here - there's all kinds of people in this world."
msgstr "来这里之后我明白了一件事——这世上什么样的人都有。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374e99
msgid "Take a look at these guns. I was the arm wrestling champion of my hometown two years running. And runner-up the year before that, and champion the year before THAT."
msgstr "看看这些枪。我连续两年是家乡的掰手腕冠军。再往前一年是亚军，再往前一年又是冠军。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374eb0
msgid "Can we have curry on Friday? I love curry!"
msgstr "周五能吃咖喱吗？我爱咖喱！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374eb1
msgid "I used to be in the army, but the government sold us out. Is there anything worth risking your life for anymore?"
msgstr "我以前在军队，但政府把我们卖了。现在还有什么值得拿命去拼的吗？"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374eb2
msgid "You stay here too long, you start losing track of what day it is."
msgstr "在这儿待久了，就分不清今天是几号了。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374eb3
msgid "Ready for duty, chief!"
msgstr "准备就绪，长官！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374eb4
msgid "I like to CALL people on the radio while I'm on a mission. It's a good way to get useful info, and it reminds me I'm not alone out there."
msgstr "出任务时我喜欢用无线电呼叫别人。既能拿到有用情报，也让我知道自己不是孤身一人。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374eb5
msgid "I'm a slave to fashion. I collect T-shirts in my spare time."
msgstr "我是时尚的奴隶。空闲时收集T恤。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374eb6
msgid "It's important to know what to wear, even on the battlefield. The right clothes for the right occasion."
msgstr "知道该穿什么很重要，哪怕在战场上。什么场合穿什么衣服。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374eb7
msgid "Listen to the waves. Smell the fresh sea air. Soothing, isn't it..."
msgstr "听听海浪。闻闻清新的海风。很舒服吧……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374eb8
msgid "I got a buddy named Johnny. You know him?"
msgstr "我有个哥们叫Johnny。你认识？"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374eb9
msgid "You don't want to over-grill a ration. But if you're just gonna lightly toast it, I say you're better off not grilling at all."
msgstr "口粮别烤过头。但要是只稍微烤一下，我看还不如不烤。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ed0
msgid "Hello there! Remember me? We met a while back. Thanks for helping me out then..."
msgstr "你好！还记得我吗？我们之前见过。谢谢你那时帮我……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ed1
msgid "I'm no good with people. Please look after me."
msgstr "我不太会跟人打交道。请多关照。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ed2
msgid "I was just thinking the same thing as you, Boss"
msgstr "BOSS，我刚想的跟你一样"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ed3
msgid "I can't believe you took me in, Boss... I'll do my best not to disappoint, but I'd totally understand if you have to sack me."
msgstr "真不敢相信你收留了我，BOSS……我会尽力不让你失望，但你要开除我我也完全理解。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ed4
msgid "Let's put our heads together and make Mother Base grow!"
msgstr "让我们一起努力，把母基地发展壮大！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ed5
msgid "If you want to create a change in time, don't blindly abide by society's rules. Be able to evaluate what is right and wrong on your own...   Right Boss? "
msgstr "想改变时代，就别盲从社会的规则。要能自己判断对错……对吧BOSS？"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ed6
msgid "You sure love your cardboard boxes, Boss... I love 'em too."
msgstr "你还真是喜欢纸箱啊，BOSS……我也喜欢。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ed7
msgid "I got a daughter back home. Haven't seen her in years..."
msgstr "我老家有个女儿，好多年没见了……"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ed8
msgid "When this battle's over, I'm gonna go home and be a shrimper. Me and my buddies are gonna pitch in an buy a big boat!"
msgstr "等这场仗打完，我就回家当捕虾的。跟兄弟们凑钱买条大船！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ed9
msgid "I cut my bangs too short."
msgstr "刘海剪太短了。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ef0
msgid "Hah, hah, hah, hah... nothing like pumping some iron!"
msgstr "哈，哈，哈，哈……举铁就是爽！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ef1
msgid "You ever tried chorizo? It's a Mexican sausage. Good stuff, especially when you fry it up with eggs!"
msgstr "你吃过chorizo吗？墨西哥香肠。好东西，跟鸡蛋一起煎尤其香！"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x374ef2
msgid "You a cat person or a dog person, Boss? Me, I'm a cat person... Ah... AH... ACHOO! Too bad I'm also allergic to them."
msgstr "BOSS，你是猫派还是狗派？我是猫派……啊……啊……阿嚏！可惜我对猫过敏。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x37618c
msgid " I am Vladimir Zadornov, and Vladimir means \"ruler of peace.\""
msgstr "我是弗拉基米尔·扎多尔诺夫，弗拉基米尔意为“和平的统治者”。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x552cb3
msgid ""
"If you see any UMAs, you tell me, OK?\n"
"Like ancient dinosaurs and rare monsters and stuff.\n"
"When I grow up, I wanna be a hunter."
msgstr ""
"要是看到未知生物，就告诉我，确定？\n"
"比如古代恐龙、稀有怪物之类的。\n"
"我长大了想当猎人。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x580daa
msgid "We abandoned our countries. Nothing more."
msgstr "我们抛弃了祖国。仅此而已。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x6747b0
msgid ""
"Why was a legendary hero forced to betray her country? Why was she targeted for assassination by you, her most beloved disciple?\n"
"I've no use for fabrications.\n"
"I want the truth... The Boss's last will. "
msgstr ""
"为何一位传奇英雄被迫背叛祖国？为何她会被你最敬爱的弟子你盯上暗杀？\n"
"我不需要编造。\n"
"我要真相……THE BOSS的遗愿。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x6ade44
msgid "(不要)「………」（大塚さん（声優）一言コメント仮）"
msgstr "(不要)「………」（大塚さん（声優）一言コメント仮）"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x72ae4f
msgid ""
"I've been thinking of giving up on studying birds and learning to fly myself.\n"
"\n"
"Want to hear my quetzal call?"
msgstr ""
"我一直在想，干脆别研究鸟了，自己去学飞。\n"
"\n"
"想听听我的凤尾绿咬鹃叫声吗？"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0x74af6c
msgid "(不要)「………」（杉田さん（声優）一言コメント仮）"
msgstr "(不要)「………」（杉田さん（声優）一言コメント仮）"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0xb73990
msgid "We're not mercenaries. We're not a foreign legion. MSF's a business. A new kind of business."
msgstr "我们不是雇佣兵。我们不是外籍军团。MSF是生意。一种全新的生意。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0xe3d5fb
msgid "...."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x840500/0xf1c147
msgid "You need a special talent to become cacique. It takes someone great to unite all of las compas."
msgstr "要当上首领得有特殊才能。得是了不起的人才能团结所有同伴。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x9f6ee7/0x01487a
msgid ""
"A young, peace-loving Costa Rican girl.\n"
"\n"
"She is a pupil of Professor Gálvez, studying her country's peace constitution at the nascent University for Peace.\n"
"\n"
"She was kidnapped by a mysterious armed group that has begun to spread throughout Costa Rica.\n"
"\n"
"Together with Gálvez, she has come to seek MSF's help in removing the invaders from her country.\n"
"\n"
"The name Paz means \"peace\" in Spanish."
msgstr ""
"一位爱好和平的年轻哥斯达黎加女孩。\n"
"\n"
"她是加尔维斯教授的学生，在刚成立的和平大学研究本国的和平宪法。\n"
"\n"
"她被一个开始在哥斯达黎加蔓延的神秘武装组织绑架。\n"
"\n"
"她与加尔维斯一同前来，寻求MSF帮助，将入侵者赶出她的国家。\n"
"\n"
"帕兹在西班牙语中意为“和平”。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x9f6ee7/0x6747b0
msgid ""
"Once a promising young scientist at NASA, Dr. Strangelove later moved to the U.S. Defense Advanced Research Projects Agency (DARPA) and devoted herself to AI research.\n"
"\n"
"She is a misanthrope and rarely deigns to show herself around other people."
msgstr ""
"斯特兰奇洛夫博士曾是NASA前途无量的年轻科学家，后转至美国国防高级研究计划局（DARPA），投身AI研究。\n"
"\n"
"她厌恶人类，很少在人前露面。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x9f6ee7/0x72ae4f
msgid ""
"A French ornithologist.\n"
"\n"
"She came to Costa Rica to research Central American bird populations, but got lost among some mysterious ruins and was taken captive by persons unknown. "
msgstr ""
"一位法国的鸟类学家。\n"
"\n"
"她来哥斯达黎加研究中美洲鸟类种群，却在神秘遗迹中迷路，被不明人士俘虏。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0x9f6ee7/0xf1c147
msgid ""
"The daughter of the comandante of the Frente Sandinista de Liberación Nacional (FSLN), and a guerrilla fighter who aims to spark a revolution in Nicaragua.\n"
"\n"
"She fled to Costa Rica to escape persecution, but her father was killed by a mysterious armed group, and the task of leading the Frente fell to her."
msgstr ""
"桑地诺民族解放阵线（FSLN）司令官之女，立志在尼加拉瓜掀起革命的游击战士。\n"
"\n"
"她为躲避迫害逃往哥斯达黎加，但父亲被神秘武装组织杀害，领导Frente的重任便落到她肩上。"

#: slot/0x004c49a2/0xb6efb4/0x01487a
msgid "Paz Ortega Andrade"
msgstr "帕兹·奥尔特加·安德拉德"

